","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.003.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 4","telopX":0,"telop":"これは世間を憚る遠慮というよりも、\nその方が私にとって自然だからである。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":4,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）これはせけんをはばかるえんりょというよりも、そのほうがわたしにとってしぜんだからである。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"F31B4D34-5F37-4623-ADFC-E443DCEB4988","duration":4.4,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"90EC7DB9-0AC8-48F1-8180-900C1C9BE18E","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"C7394C6A-F8F8-4180-965A-94EC26C188E2","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"これはせけんをはばかるえんりょというよりも、そのほうがわたしにとってしぜんだからである。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.004.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 5","telopX":0,"telop":"私はその人の記憶を呼び起こすごとに、\nすぐ「先生」といいたくなる。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":5,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub