F-E701-4791-98B0-9E4559D077F1","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"ふでをとってもこころもちはおなじことである。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.006.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 7","telopX":0,"telop":"よそよそしい頭文字などはとても使う気になれない。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":7,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）よそよそしいかしらもじなどはとてもつかうきになれない。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"01AC80E4-F0B0-4ECC-B234-AB3E8EFAEB5D","duration":3.5,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"25A0AAA1-E069-4923-942F-BA97C4D4C6BB","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"1B7B1A9B-8809-43EA-8118-C39F226C4C32","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"よそよそしいかしらもじなどはとてもつかうきになれない。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.007.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 8","telopX":0,"telop":"私が先生と知り合いになったのは鎌倉である。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":8,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）わたしがせんせいとしりあいになったのはかまくらである。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"AEDA1B1A-1F33-4E1B-87EC-BC954584ADA3","duration":3.5,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"DF5ABCD2-CDFA-4129-BC60-2DEC15954EE4","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"E9869FD4-DD5A-4AC7-900B-DFA1C4000233","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"わたしがせんせいとしりあいになったのはかまくらである。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.008.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 9","telopX":0,"telop":"その時私はまだ若々しい書生であった。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":9,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）そのときわたしはまだわかわかしいしょせいであった。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"951EA8D1-A655-4484-AD31-5DD1C40E7911","duration":3.5,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"768BDBC5-0E33-4376-88C8-01C1F496BA96","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"E260BBB4-E20F-49A4-8B0A-5849FA3BE2B1","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"そのときわたしはまだわかわかしいしょせいであった。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.009.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 10","telopX":0,"telop":"暑中休暇を利用して海水浴に行った友達からぜひ来いという端書を受け取ったので、私は多少の金を工面して、出掛ける事にした。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":10,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）しょちゅうきゅうかをりようしてかいすいよくにいったともだちからぜひこいというはしがきをうけとったので、わたしはたしょうのかねをくめんして、でかけることにした。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"46A99991-CB37-446E-82D7-3BDB72F0260B","duration":7.9,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"0D4DE177-79CD-4D0B-B2C0-E87F3256B994","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"E9987784-7EE1-4DA2-85AE-16FAACD25B27","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"しょちゅうきゅうかをりようしてかいすいよくにいったともだちからぜひこいというはしがきをうけとったので、わたしはたしょうのかねをくめんして、でかけることにした。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.010.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 11","telopX":0,"telop":"私は金の工面に二、三日を費やした。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDela