edObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":27,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）たまつきだのあいすくりーむだのというはいからなものにはながいなわてをひとつこさなければてがとどかなかった。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"AFF67894-2C38-4034-ACD8-B2721417C179","duration":5.300000000000001,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"5F952B1A-B566-4416-A75D-BB1D670E810A","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"04A10D7C-2828-47BC-81A4-B943DD479632","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"たまつきだのあいすくりーむだのというはいからなものにはながいなわてをひとつこさなければてがとどかなかった。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.027.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 28","telopX":0,"telop":"車で行っても二十銭は取られた。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":28,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）くるまでいってもにじゅっせんはとられた。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"971CD79D-8CD3-4050-A2E5-03F2C7221F8A","duration":3.5,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"63AA95E3-7DEE-4946-B1B7-79D4DCE43AF9","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"AE57BE50-E4E8-41BE-BF7E-0EFB1A6DE3AE","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"くるまでいってもにじゅっせんはとられた。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.028.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 29","telopX":0,"telop":"それに海へはごく近いので海水浴を\nやるには至極便利な地位を占めていた。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":29,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）それにうみへはごくちかいのでかいすいよくをやるにはしごくべんりなちいをしめていた。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"21C7F42D-9B8A-44CF-81E8-CFD4AE80EC51","duration":4.1000000000000005,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"EEC0CC6D-8AD4-494B-BABC-992A0C311182","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"4B583BBD-8AD2-40D3-B1F9-0AEEFE65B74A","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"それにうみへはごくちかいのでかいすいよくをやるにはしごくべんりなちいをしめていた。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.029.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 30","telopX":0,"telop":"私は毎日海へはいりに出掛けた。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":30,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）わたしはまいにちうみへはいりにでかけた。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"CB8601B3-4D26-4283-BFD8-C72CDB563B32","duration":3.5,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"025EE2DB-DCFD-4008-9453-DD786E059A20","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"B44DE31F-D664-44B3-89F2-13EB2C9BA410","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"わたしはまいにちうみへはいりにでかけた。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.030.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 31","telopX":0,"telop":"古い燻ぶり返った藁葺の間を通り抜けて磯へ下りると、この辺にこれほどの都会人種が住んでいるかと思うほど、避暑に来た男や女で砂の上が動いていた。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":31,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）ふるいくすぶりかえったわらぶきのあいだをとおりぬけていそへくだると、このへんにこれほどのとかいじんしゅがすんでいるかとおもうほど、ひしょにきたおとこやおんなですなのうえがうごいていた。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"D0DEF058-D473-454F-B290-9A23C6A63749","duration":9.200000000000001,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"F3CC1097-D32B-420D-B92D-95017F035009","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"430E2808-330C-4AB1-9B60-0F05F773EC4D","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"ふるいくすぶりかえったわらぶきのあいだをとおりぬけていそへくだると、このへんにこれほどのとかいじんしゅがすんでいるかとおもうほど、ひしょにきたおとこやおんなですなのうえがうごいていた。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.031.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 32","telopX":0,"telop":"ある時は海の中が銭湯のように黒い頭で\nごちゃごちゃしている事もあった。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":32,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）あるときはうみのなかがせんとうのようにくろいあたまでごちゃごちゃしていることもあった。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"F5F1EE9E-F835-4C19-BCF5-FEABD2145931","duration":4.3,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"D18CA315-6387-493F-BE79-483D15A67C27","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"1AEB351C-5AD1-4566-ACD1-594BD55E5E2C","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"あるときはうみのなかがせんとうのようにくろいあたまでごちゃごちゃしていることもあった。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.032.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 33","telopX":0,"telop":"その中に知った人を一人ももたない私も、こういう賑やかな景色の中に裹まれて、砂の上に寝そべってみたり、膝頭を波に打たしてそこいらを跳ね廻るのは愉快であった。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":33,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）そのなかにしったひとをひとりももたないわたしも、こういうにぎやかなけしきのなかにうらまれて、すなのうえにねそべってみたり、ひざあたまをなみにうたしてそこいらをはねまわるのはゆかいであった。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"54F8440C-213A-4D22-B213-49640FB2D8DD","duration":9.4,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"C5F5FC66-B76A-41B7-A525-4EA8D3199CFE","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"139FBA12-74DD-4BA3-B157-F677D860E10F","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"そのなかにしったひとをひとりももたないわたしも、こういうにぎやかなけしきのなかにうらまれて、すなのうえにねそべってみたり、ひざあたまをなみにうたしてそこいらをはねまわるのはゆかいであった。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.033.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 34","telopX":0,"telop":"私は実に先生をこの雑沓の間に見付け出したのである。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":34,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）わたしはじつにせんせいをこのざっとうのあいだにみつけだしたのである。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"FA12831C-B2C2-4CF7-B7E0-32843BD9E4CB","duration":3.5,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"321EE5B9-D4DC-4F81-95CB-A5AA97AC83E7","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"3DE84C89-24E5-4E85-9D37-D8CBD1657480","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"わたしはじつにせんせいをこのざっとうのあいだにみつけだしたのである。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.034.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 35","telopX":0,"telop":"その時海岸には掛茶屋が二軒あった。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":35,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）そのときかいがんにはかけじゃやがにけんあった。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"DEF8314A-BF8E-4950-9882-E7129136FEE6","duration":3.5,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"FC5B1F37-FDA6-4213-98E8-ED4128B02485","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"BCD12D05-8CE8-46E1-9342-A4B3B8A0D2F5","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"そのときかいがんにはかけじゃやがにけんあった。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.035.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 36","telopX":0,"telop":"私はふとした機会からその一軒の方に行き慣れていた。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":36,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）わたしはふとしたきかいからそのいっけんのほうにいきなれていた。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"97D69FE1-EB29-4142-BBEA-EFFDC4F9B0BB","duration":3.5,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"C4A6AE39-47E0-4F2D-BA4F-820E3868BC1E","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"DCF78088-A4C7-4903-B404-E62AC3BDE577","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"わたしはふとしたきかいからそのいっけんのほうにいきなれていた。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.036.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 37","telopX":0,"telop":"長谷辺に大きな別荘を構えている人と違って、各自に専有の着換場を拵えていないここいらの避暑客には、ぜひともこうした共同着換所といった風なものが必要なのであった。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":37,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）はせべにおおきなべっそうをかまえているひととちがって、かくじにせんゆうのきがえばをこしらえていないここいらのひしょきゃくには、ぜひともこうしたきょうどうきがえじょといったふうなものがひつようなのであった。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"4E7A0388-BB10-4EC4-B147-A7CC587981DC","duration":10.200000000000001,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"52043A15-AA1E-413B-8F02-CF4CDF0F41AB","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"B961C318-635B-422C-8926-D7770BB593FB","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"はせべにおおきなべっそうをかまえているひととちがって、かくじにせんゆうのきがえばをこしらえていないここいらのひしょきゃくには、ぜひともこうしたきょうどうきがえじょといったふうなものがひつようなのであった。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.037.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 38","telopX":0,"telop":"彼らはここで茶を飲み、ここで休息する外に、ここで海水着を洗濯させたり、ここで鹹はゆい身体を清めたり、ここへ帽子や傘を預けたりするのである。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":38,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）かれらはここでちゃをのみ、ここできゅうそくするほかに、ここですいすいぎをせんたくさせたり、ここでしおはゆいからだをきよめたり、ここへぼうしやかさをあずけたりするのである。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"B53440C4-D163-4E70-AFA8-9B37876E7A21","duration":8.5,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"010D5973-E83F-4DD1-BD17-52427BE67361","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"CC6401E3-2911-4460-B51D-EFB69BCAAAC5","objectType":"image"}],"presenterNote":"かれらはここでちゃをのみ、ここできゅうそくするほかに、ここですいすいぎをせんたくさせたり、ここでしおはゆいからだをきよめたり、ここへぼうしやかさをあずけたりするのである。","transitionTag":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.038.jpeg"},{"backgroundHeight":1080,"title":"シーン 39","telopX":0,"telop":"海水着を持たない私にも持物を盗まれる恐れはあったので、\n私は海へはいるたびにその茶屋へ一切を脱ぎ棄てる事にしていた。","telopWidth":1920,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","detectedObjects":["オブジェクト:tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","オブジェクト:tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg"],"telopHeight":225,"transitionDelay":0,"slideWidth":1920,"transitionDuration":0,"backgroundY":0,"transitionEffect":"なし","slideIndex":39,"transitionTrigger":"クリック時","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","rawPresenterNote":"（操夢）うみみずぎをもたないわたしにももちものをぬすまれるおそれはあったので、わたしはうみへはいるたびにそのちゃやへいっさいをぬぎすてることにしていた。","telopY":855,"slideType":"content","id":"26CAE8CA-162C-48B5-93DD-14AA4CFAF30E","duration":7.2,"animationTag":"なし","slideHeight":1080,"buildOrder":[],"characterName":"操夢","backgroundX":0,"backgroundWidth":1920,"animations":[],"objects":[{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_medgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"39834266-A67A-4217-926E-D5E36507D695","objectType":"image"},{"animations":[],"name":"tile_paper_ltgray.jpeg","y":100,"height":300,"x":100,"width":300,"id":"8D8A1027-2283-4BF8-A97A-1